      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebihanda by'Abazini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi n'abakuru b'omulimo, kandi bakakoma abamu ha batabani b'Asafu, aba Hemani, n'aba Yedusuuni, barangege nibateera enanga, endongo, n'ebitaasa. Abaakoraga omulimo, buli muntu ogu akaba ahairwe nubo banu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha batabani b'Asafu, Zakura, Yosefu, Netaniya n'Asaleera, baayebemberwaga isebo Asafu, ow'akaba naaranga omukama nkooku yamuragiraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha batabani ba Yedusuuni: Gedaliya, Zeeri, Yesaaya, Simeyi, Hasabbiya, na Matisiya, boona hamu mukaaga, baayebemberwaga isebo Yedusuuni, ow'akaba naaranga naateera enanga naasiima kandi naahaisaniza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha batabani ba Hemani: Bukiya, Mataniya, Uziyeri Sebbuweri, Yerimoosi, Hananiya, Hanani, Eryasa, Gidariti, Romamutizeeri, Yosibbekasa, Maroosi, Hosiri na Mahaziyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boona, bakaba bali batabani ba Hemani omurangi wa MUKAMA, Ruhanga nkooku yanihiize kumunyumiza; habwokuba akaba amuhaire abaana aboojo ikumi na bbana abaisiki basatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boona baayebemberwaga isebo, nibazina ebizina omunju ya MUKAMA, nibateera ebitaasa, endongo n'enanga nibakora omulimo ogw'omunju ya Ruhanga. Asafu, Yedusuuni na Hemani, omukama nuwe yabaragiraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo gwabu, hamu na bagenzi baabo abakaba batendekerwe kuzinira MUKAMA, boona abakaba baina amagezi, bakaba nibahika ebikumi bibiri kinaana na munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emirimo yabu yateererwaga itomo, abato n'abakuru, abeegesa n'abeegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
